WEBVTT

00:13:58.171 --> 00:14:04.104
And what I thought to myself was:
if domestic workers were in charge,

00:14:04.128 --> 00:14:05.932
this never would have happened.

00:14:06.916 --> 00:14:11.846
Our humanity would never
have been so disposable

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:14.543
that we would be treating
children in this way.

00:14:17.304 --> 00:14:23.084
The Dalai Lama once said
that love and compassion are necessities,

00:14:23.877 --> 00:14:25.525
not luxuries.

00:14:26.597 --> 00:14:30.237
Without them, humanity cannot survive.